# The product of what comes round and a large constant is a 64-bit integer that would have to be asked in every turn whether it is an int32, and nearly never is: then the turn does the work
# twice. Beside an element of a list it stays a number, as it was before the element was known for an int32.
# f1 = mixed
# RUN: compile ExactIntegersBehindNumbers mechanisms=all
# CHECK: statistic ExactIntegersBehindNumbers 0
